				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1486,
				2
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Format hover command interface and import declarations\n\nAlign the formatting of the `Hover` command module with the project's Rust style standards. Reformat the multi-line `use` statement in `Source/Command/Hover/Fn.rs` to improve readability and consistency with the explicit namespace qualification pattern used throughout Mountain. Update the documentation comment block in `Source/Command/Hover/Interface.rs` to wrap long lines and maintain a uniform column width.\n\nNo functional logic is altered; these changes ensure adherence to the codebase's strict formatting conventions and improve maintainability of the hover interaction DTOs.",
			"SHA": "e1ba0eceee3e6ff24d8bc8a4350482255b455ad1"
		},
